[[2,63,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the connector (1a) and undo the two bolts (1b) fixing\nthe solenoid valve (1c) to the mounting bracket (1d).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Variable geometry turbine solenoid valve</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890739\">L36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034209.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,65536,"<p>1. Mark the pipes (1a) underneath to facilitate refitting, then\ndisconnect them and remove the valve (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034210.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the pipes at the bottom of the\nvalve.</p><p>Position the solenoid valve and tighten\nthe two bolts fixing it to the mounting bracket.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Variable geometry turbine solenoid valve</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890739\">L36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891253\">1048A10</a></p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]